tmuxake functionality is easy to add on top of tmu, we need to remember which pane last borrowed a utility and move it back and forth

borrowing a non-running utility starts it

borrow a borrowed utility is possible, it's unborrowed and borrowed
	the utility has a history, returning it returns it to one step back in its history
	it's possible to borrow without updating the history, as well as returning anywhere in the history, including home which is at position 0

borrow a utility in place of a borrowed utility
	with history

borrow utility in place of a non managed window
	non managed window becomes a flip flop
